# Core AI Entry

Read root `AGENTS.md` first, then `MEMORY.md` and `AI_BOARD.md`.

`AI_BOARD.md` is the only active collaboration board. Keep every open or blocked item there. Move closed conclusions, implementation notes, and test evidence to `.ai/docs/`, module docs, or `.ai/docs/archive/`.

Use `.ai/instructions/` as the source of detailed rules:

- `.ai/instructions/ai-workflow.md`
- `.ai/instructions/backend-go-edge.md`
- `.ai/instructions/frontend-electron-react.md`
- `.ai/instructions/testing-smoke.md`

Historical database sync is handled by external database sync software. Application code owns realtime SSE/WS and method/control RabbitMQ or HTTP boundaries only after confirmation.
